1 0 obj<</Author(MashpotatoeQueen)/CreationDate(D:20261101012845+00'00')/Creator(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Keywords(Fanworks, Not Rated, She-Ra and the Princesses of Power \(2018\), Frosta \(She-Ra\), Adora \(She-Ra\), Glimmer \(She-Ra\), Frosta is now my smol child, i adore her, She be my fave, This fic basically tries to explain why she might be like how she is, Frosta is Adorable, This Is Why We Can't Have Nice Things, Because I like to torture myself, and give characters I love sad backstories, OC character - Freeform, But she's minor, Written before Season 2, So probably a bunch isn't actually canon, headcanons, Frosta is so done, Frosta is BAMF, Frosta is smol, I love her, Assassins & Hitmen, Attempted Kidnapping, Minor Character Death, Minor Original Character\(s\), Anxiety, Snow and Ice, Ice Powers, Kingdom of Snow, The Princess Prom, Injury, Blood and Injury, Character Death, okay but seriously, Something PRETTY MESSED UP must have happened, If there's an eleven year old child on the throne, Gen, No Archive Warnings Apply)/ModDate(D:20261101012845+00'00')/Producer(calibre \(9.17.0\) [https://calibre-ebook.com])/Title(Young)>>
